<title>USA: Goldman Sachs wins $200 mln Mass. Bay Transport.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs wins $200 mln Mass. Bay Transport.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co said it won $200 million of Massachusetts Bay Transportation Authority general transportation system bonds, 1996 Series B, with a true interest cost of 5.674 percent.</p>
</text>
